{"4977130": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Ancient Caverns", "steam_appid": 4977130, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The caverns are never the same twice</h2>Beneath the old world, a wound in the earth swallows everyone brave — or foolish — enough to enter. Take up a class, step through the mouth of the cave, and descend floor by floor into a dark-fantasy roguelite where every run carves a new path through shifting biomes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/214cc37afa454f134f0dc68924b680e6.poster.avif?t=1786691363\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/214cc37afa454f134f0dc68924b680e6.webm?t=1786691363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/214cc37afa454f134f0dc68924b680e6.mp4?t=1786691363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Every descent starts fresh</h2>You enter with nothing but your class and your wits. Weapons, armour, reagents and gold are found — and lost — in the dark. Fall, and the caverns keep your gear... but the rare artifacts you drag back to the surface are yours forever, quietly making the next adventurer stronger.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Roguelite descent</strong> — procedurally generated floors across distinct biomes; no two runs alike.<br></li><li><strong>Pick your class</strong> — warrior, mage, rogue or alchemist, each with its own gear, skills and rhythm.<br></li><li><strong>Spells &amp; a skill tree</strong> — hurl firebolts, frost novas and chain lightning, and spend hard-won points to grow a build all your own.<br></li><li><strong>Tier-scaled combat</strong> — monsters grow with the depths you reach, not a fixed clock; the deep floors are a real test.<br></li><li><strong>Permanent artifacts</strong> — recover relics that persist between runs and unlock lasting power.<br></li><li><strong>Loot and craft</strong> — gather reagents, brew potions, and forge your build from whatever the caverns give you.<br></li><li><strong>A town to call home</strong> — return to the surface to spend gold, take on villager quests, and fill the Artifact Museum.<br></li><li><strong>One more floor</strong> — permadeath runs tuned so a skilled delver reaches the depths, and the best keep chasing them.</li></ul><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/b1f498d208e34b1cb4af6dec7001ffa9.poster.avif?t=1786691363\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/b1f498d208e34b1cb4af6dec7001ffa9.webm?t=1786691363\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/b1f498d208e34b1cb4af6dec7001ffa9.mp4?t=1786691363\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >How deep will you go?</h2>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >The caverns are never the same twice</h2>Beneath the old world, a wound in the earth swallows everyone brave — or foolish — enough to enter. Take up a class, step through the mouth of the cave, and descend floor by floor into a dark-fantasy roguelite where every run carves a new path through shifting biomes.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/214cc37afa454f134f0dc68924b680e6.poster.avif?t=1786691363\" width=540 height=360 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4977130/extras/214cc37