> Runs on integrated graphics — requires OpenGL 3.3. No dedicated GPU needed.</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04 LTS / SteamOS 3.x or newer (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual-core x86-64, 2.0 GHz (Intel Core i3 or equivalent)<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.3-compatible GPU with Mesa 20+ drivers<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 500 MB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> PulseAudio / PipeWire compatible<br></li><li><strong>Additional Notes:</strong> Verified on Steam Deck. Requires OpenGL 3.3 (Mesa). glibc 2.31+.</li></ul>"}, "legal_notice": "© 2026 Meridian Studios. All rights reserved.", "developers": ["Meridian Studios"], "publishers": ["Meridian Studios"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 999, "final": 999, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$9.99"}, "packages": [1726916], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy The Ancient Caverns", "description": "", "selection_text": "Select a purchase option", "save_text": "", "display_type": 0, "is_recurring_subscription": "false", "subs": [{"packageid": 1726916, "percent_savings_text": " ", "percent_savings": 0, "option_text": "The Ancient Caverns - $9.99", "option_description": "", "can_get_free_license": "0", "is_free_license": false, "price_in_cents_with_discount": 999}]}], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": true}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 67, "description": "Camera Comfort"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 23, "description": "Steam Cloud"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "1", "description": "Action"}, {"id":